{
 "schema": "suborned.robotfaces/1",
 "note": "Faces for DK_RobotFace.shader (unity/Assets/Suborned/Shaders/DecoKit) driven by RobotFace.cs / RobotIdle.cs of the old project (Scripts/Robots), which Latch ports. Glyph atlas: RobotGlyphs.txt packed into 8 x 8 tiles in a row, r = lit, g = glyph height / 8, glyphs bottom-left, point filtered, global texture _DK_RobotGlyphs. Screens are the renderers named *_Face on the model (here DK_<Robot>_Play_Head_Face); heads are *_Head. grid / corner / eye / mouth are LED cells; eye = the viewer's-right eye centre from the grid centre, the left is its mirror. Idle: range deg, turn s, hold s, home = chance a glance returns ahead. Moods held out need Sky.",
